<div class="articles-prologue">
    <p class="articles-epigraph"><em>"Pure religion and undefiled before God and the Father is this…"</em></p>
    <p>These declarations reflect the belief that followers of Jesus Christ have more things in common than the things which divide us. These articles are not meant to be a formal creed of a single religious tradition, but a foundation of peaceful fellowship. It is in the spirit of "unity of faith" that we offer this olive branch to all who are willing to sit together and partake of His grace.</p>
</div>

